   "body_html": "@Michi The book has many factual and typographic errors (google K&amp;R errata), it is only somewhat compatible with the C90 standard, it does not address the current C standard nor any changes in the language since 1990. Worst of all it is filled with bad programming practice, bad style and code which relies on poorly-specified behavior. All of which you have to unlearn if you become a professional C programmer."
